WEBVTT

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
<b>Chio's</b>

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
School Road

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.150
Crap... My chest hurts.

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:35.690
<b>Bloody Butterfly Effect</b>

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:36.150
It's definitely a symptom 
of sleep deprivation.

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:39.740
I just need to make sure I don't 
get in trouble for falling asleep.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.660
<i>I did it again...</i>

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:44.440
<i>I played online matches late into the night.</i>

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:47.140
<i>I only planned to play for thirty minutes...</i>

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.550
And done.

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.590
<b>Online</b>

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.590
<b>You have one new message</b>

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.590
Oh, hey. It's the foreigner 
I was just playing.

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.300
I'll just put this through 
a translation site...

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:56.220
<b>[Insult]</b>

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:00.680
Really? You can hit me from there?

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:02.110
That's a cheat! This guy's totally cheating!

00:02:02.110 --> 00:02:03.220
You dumbass!

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:06.640
<i>Some foreigner egged me on, and before 
I realized it, it was morning.</i>

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:10.310
Aw, man... I just can't help myself.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:18.380
<i>Wha...</i>

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:21.550
<i>What is that? I'm guessing...</i>

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:24.080
<i>Some motorcycle gang guy 
who just finished a ride?</i>

00:02:26.630 --> 00:02:29.830
<i>I mean, guys like that won't get 
in the face of some civilian</i>

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.790
<i>just peacefully walking by, right?</i>

00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:34.960
<i>Let alone some below-average 
high school girl like me...</i>

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:36.260
<i>Wait...</i>

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:40.180
<b>Delinquent</b>

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:40.180
<b>Bike</b>

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:40.180
<b>Old guy</b>

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:40.180
<b>Me</b>

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:37.490
<i>That jerk is gonna</i>

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.180
<i>make me walk closer to the 
delinquent because he's scared!</i>

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:43.510
<i>You can't be serious! You totally 
look like a section chief!</i>

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:46.180
<i>No, I don't have time to worry 
about people's titles right now.</i>

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:48.140
<i>I just need to quietly and peacefully...</i>

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:51.060
<i>Damn it, this bike is in the way! N-No room!</i>

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:52.480
<i>Just a little more...</i>

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:54.900
<i>Hey, don't push me, section chief guy!</i>

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:57.740
<b>Trivia Corner</b>

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:04.200
Trivia
Corner

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:04.200
<b>You call the
exhaust pipe
by the wheel 
a "muffler"</b>

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:04.200
<b>After riding, it's 
extremely hot, 
sometimes over 
200 degrees 
Celsius</b>

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:04.200
<b>Danger!</b>

00:02:57.950 --> 00:03:01.170
<i>You call the exhaust pipe 
by the wheel a "muffler."</i>

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:00.510
Cool!

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:02.000
My, my!

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:04.200
<i>After riding, it's extremely hot, 
sometimes over 200 degrees Celsius.</i>

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:05.910
<i>If you touch it...</i>

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:08.050
Ngaaaah!

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:09.500
<i>This is what you'd sound like.</i>

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:21.340
<i>Crap. Now I've really done it.</i>

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:26.260
What are you yelling for, little girl?

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:28.350
<i>Whoa, he's huge!</i>

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:30.110
You wanna fight?

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:33.080
<i>No, no! I accidentally touched 
something really hot and...</i>

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:35.080
<i>I can't speak...</i>

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:38.940
Must think you're hot shit, 
laughing in my face like that.

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:41.070
<i>No! This is a bad habit of mine!</i>

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:43.490
Sorry, but I've got a code to follow...

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:46.530
When someone wants to fight, 
I <i>have</i> to take them on!

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:48.410
<i>No way! My feet are off the ground!</i>

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:50.870
<i>Help me, old guy!</i>

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:53.960
Hurgh!

00:03:57.710 --> 00:04:01.130
I'm sorry! It's almost time for 
my part-time job interview!

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:07.660
I won.

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:11.000
I need to get going before he wakes up...

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.540
This is a bit dangerous.

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:18.020
Someone might get burnt like me. 
I should move it to the side a little.

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:20.440
I'm sure it's like some heavy bicycle.

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:22.960
Hey, it's really easy to move—

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:34.540
<i>Chio! What the hell is wrong with you?!</i>

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:36.070
<i>This sucks! This sucks! This sucks!</i>

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:39.710
<i>Now I'm totally the bad guy in all this!</i>

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:39.710
<b>Property damage</b>

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.710
<b>Injured someone</b>

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:44.330
<i>Crap! He's regaining consciousness.</i>

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:45.820
<i>What should I do? What should I do?!</i>

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:47.820
<i>This all started because he—</i>

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:56.870
Hey. You awake?

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:00.870
You bitch... My bike...

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:03.150
What the hell do you think you're doing?!

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:06.700
<i>He probably knows that I go to 
Samejima Academy by my uniform...</i>

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.330
<i>Even if I run, it's only a matter 
of time until he finds me.</i>

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:12.240
The ground's dirty, so I laid this under me.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:13.320
Huh?

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:15.910
<i>I'm damned if I do and damned if I don't...</i>

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:18.750
Bitch, do you know what you're doing?

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:19.720
<i>So I'm just going to act defiant
and settle things here!</i>

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:21.810
You're the one who doesn't understand.

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:25.260
I held back earlier so I wouldn't kill you.

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:28.130
You don't really think you just 
underestimated some random girl

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:31.240
and accidentally got your 
ass handed to you, do you?

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:34.210
<i>What the hell is she...</i>

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:36.730
<i>Wait, she was laughing to begin with.</i>

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:37.910
Hey...

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:39.650
Who the hell are you?

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:41.770
My name?

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:45.640
Man, it's always nerve-racking 
when you start a new game.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.840
I'll use my usual name...

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.950
<b>Bloody Butterfly</b>

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:50.210
Bloody Butterfly.

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:51.490
<b>Bloody Butterfly</b>

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:54.120
I've never heard of any Bloody Butterfly!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.120
Get over yourself—

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.570
Of course you haven't.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:56.810
Huh?

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:59.290
I'm on a completely different level than you.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:02.440
While y'all are being buddy-buddy 
playing motorcycle gang,

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:07.220
I'm packing heat and having shootouts 
with some foreigners every night.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:08.520
Packing heat?

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:11.090
Proxy wars? Working in the shadows?

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:12.320
Oh, don't kill me!

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:15.110
Who the hell would believe tha—

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:15.510
Listen up. I'll let you off with a warning.

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:19.310
Stop riding around on this lame 
souped-up bike and quit your gang now.

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:20.060
Huh?

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.150
It's a waste of time.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:26.300
You just keep fighting and fighting and 
fighting with other gangs, but for what?

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:28.190
What's beyond all that?

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:30.360
You want to set foot on my side?

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:34.080
I'm shooting out with people, killing 
people, and once dawn rolls around,

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:32.970
It's already morning.

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:36.210
My chest hurts... I'll never game again.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.390
I'm filled with regret.

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:38.540
I can't go back to being normal.

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:38.540
Must... not... click...

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:41.670
Whoo! Now I can fight nonstop!

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:41.670
I've seen countless guys get crippled for life.

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:44.800
And I can summon real food just 
by stomping on the floor!

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:44.800
You want to wear a diaper and piss 
yourself when you're this young?

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:46.260
C-Crippled?!

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.120
I'm trying to be nice here.

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:51.250
Don't become like me.

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:55.670
Shoot for below average. Try to be normal.

00:06:55.670 --> 00:06:58.640
Peace is the most wonderful, 
yet most difficult thing.

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:04.690
<i>Wh-Why? This is totally absurd, 
but somehow, she's really convincing!</i>

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:08.300
Are you saying you have the 
nerve to keep going around

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:10.580
dragging that busted-up bike of yours

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:13.370
after getting instantly destroyed 
by some girl one-on-one?

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:26.210
I've lost...

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:30.270
I won't bother you anymore.

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:35.080
But I want you to grant me one final wish...

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:38.090
Would you join me on my last ride,

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:41.270
at least as far as your school?

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:43.230
Huh?

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:45.860
This turned into something huge...

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:52.800
We're here.

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:58.290
Thanks, Bloody Butterfly!

00:07:58.290 --> 00:07:59.370
B—

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:00.450
B—

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:01.710
Bloody...

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:03.620
...Butterfly?!

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:05.380
Wait.

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:07.270
That name...

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.670
You're a student here, right?

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:13.840
Yessir, I am exchange student, yes?

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:16.870
I see.

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:19.930
Chio's School Road!

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.930
<b>Chio's</b>

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.930
School Road

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:25.150
<b>Manana, Ootoro, and Me</b>

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:26.900
Chio-chan, don't you think there are 
a lot of couples around lately?

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:28.940
Actually, yeah.

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:32.530
There suddenly seems to 
be a lot more around.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:35.490
And they're all first-years.

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:36.740
I'd call them...

00:08:37.730 --> 00:08:38.910
Relationship noobs.

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:50.020
Love! Love! Love! Love! Love!

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:42.870
<i>"Noobs" is a gamer term for 
beginners or amateurs.</i>

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:45.740
<i>First-years have a delusional 
outlook on high school life,</i>

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:47.230
<i>causing them to choose whoever</i>

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:50.020
<i>and enter relationships as soon 
as they start high school.</i>

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:53.420
<i>But once the magic of the 
entrance ceremony begins to fade,</i>

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:53.090
Sorry, you're not actually my type.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:54.390
Ditto.

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:57.760
<i>many of those relationship noobs 
break up during summer vacation.</i>

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:01.280
They're like amateurs stepping onto 
the battlefield for the first time.

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:04.890
They don't even plan or strategize. 
It's honestly pitiful to see.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:07.840
What are your thoughts, Chio-chan?

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:09.060
December.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:10.950
Oh? Let's hear it.

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:14.750
You only need to go out with the opposite 
sex once throughout high school.

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:19.000
When you grow up and say that you went 
out with two guys in high school,

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.490
it sounds like you just messed around.

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:36.090
Entered school

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:24.700
Toward the end of your high school 
career, relationships get in the way.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:36.090
2nd year

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:36.090
3rd year

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:27.670
Thus, you focus on enjoying relationships 
during the event season,

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:36.090
Graduation

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:31.310
from the winter of your first year 
to the summer of your second year.

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:36.090
Summer                 Winter

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:36.090
Christmas
New Year's
Valentines
Extended break

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:33.740
After that, you switch gears 
and focus on your studies.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:36.090
Below-average relationship plan diagram

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:36.090
This is my below-average relationship plan!

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:37.510
Chio-chan! This diagram...

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:39.560
I think I've seen it before.

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:39.800
Chuutoro   Ootoro

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:41.180
Ootoro

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:41.180
Ootoro!

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:42.270
So it's precisely...

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:44.350
...the most delicious time for relationships.

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:48.350
<i>This idle gossip was brought to you by two 
girls with zero relationship experience.</i>

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:50.460
I'm lying! I'm just playing tough!

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:52.150
I want to enjoy my youth, 
like everyone else!

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:53.670
Manana, you're being too loud!

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:55.990
So?! Everyone's too busy with 
who they're with, anyway!

00:09:58.150 --> 00:09:59.320
I want to go there.

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:01.120
Oh, sorry...

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:03.150
Hey, what are you doing?

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:06.540
Ha, that couple just broke up for three 
seconds... at least, physically!

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.870
<i>Man, she's a terrible person.</i>

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:12.630
How are you with romantic 
relationships, Chio-chan?

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:15.630
You basically spend all your 
time playing games, right?

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:18.050
<i>I can't say anything back...</i>

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:19.680
Hey, the couple in front of us...

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:22.420
...is so amazing.

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:21.690
It's Hosokawa-san.

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:24.390
Yeah, the star of the track team.

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:27.020
Huh? You're not going to attack them?

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:32.030
Huh? If I even tried to enter that high-level 
dimension, I'd be obliterated on impact.

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:35.780
Ah, my fellow lower-middle-class 
citizen. No wonder we get along.

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:39.460
But man, they totally look 
like the ideal couple.

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:42.700
Even I don't feel as petty when 
they're both so good-looking.

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:48.320
"Apparently, my hands are pretty big. 
My senpai asked me if I'd play bass for him."

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:51.230
"Wow! Your fingers really are long!"

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:52.820
"Hey, want to compare hands?"

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:54.130
"Wow! They're totally different!"

00:10:54.130 --> 00:11:02.850
Ueda Loan

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.200
"Are you really going to play bass?"

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:59.030
"Nah, I'm not good at anything. I couldn't."

00:10:59.030 --> 00:11:02.850
"You should at least try! 
You'd look amazing with a bass! I..."

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:03.690
Manana-san? Which one am I?

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:10.890
Th-There it is! The trump card: 
It's dangerous to walk by the road!

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:09.890
Jeez, you startled me!

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:14.900
Please stop! I'll never be able 
to maintain my composure

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:17.690
if they start drinking out 
of the same bottle next...

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:27.660
A very healthy, attractive couple...

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:31.290
...just ducked into the alleyway. This...

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:33.460
...looks like sexy times.

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:34.960
I'm just gonna take a little peek...

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:35.960
W-Wait! What are you...

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:37.670
Don't stop me, Chio-chan.

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:41.010
I need to find out what's beyond here.

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:45.020
I mean... celebrity gossip is priceless.

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:48.220
That's why I want to be 
at the center of attention.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:50.350
<i>Wow, you fail at life.</i>

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:52.850
Manana, wait. I'll go, too.

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:57.020
I mean, if our classmates are doing 
something improper, we have to stop them.

00:11:57.810 --> 00:12:01.490
And if they're going to get scolded, 
it won't be so bad if it's from the two of us.

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:05.010
<i>So she's blaming someone else for her actions</i>

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:07.220
<i>and tacking on some insurance, just in case.</i>

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:10.160
<i>Miyamo Chio, you're such a piece of shit...</i>

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:11.920
You're the best!

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:16.340
<b>Begin Sneaking</b>

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:15.710
<i>Begin sneaking.</i>

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:18.250
I've confirmed the location!

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:21.310
<i>I see... There's a T-intersection 
two blocks down.</i>

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:23.380
<i>It seems they're a bit further ahead.</i>

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:25.760
<b>This Means Nothing</b>

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:31.670
<i>I'm sorry, Hosokawa-san.</i>

00:12:31.670 --> 00:12:34.440
<i>I'm having so much fun right now!</i>

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:36.730
She's more into this than anyone else.

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:38.280
Sorry!

00:12:39.090 --> 00:12:43.780
I decided not to go out with anyone 
so that I can concentrate on track.

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:47.570
<i>He brought her in here to ask her out?</i>

00:12:48.140 --> 00:12:49.920
Because I love running...

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:54.790
I understand. Thanks for 
being honest with me.

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:57.710
This might sound selfish...

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:01.090
but I want to stay friends 
with you, Haruki-kun.

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:04.130
I was hoping you could teach me math again.

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:06.100
Okay.

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:10.560
I guess I could support your 
club activities that way.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:14.300
Then, I hope you'll introduce 
me to one of your friends.

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:15.360
You have lots of them, right?

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:18.110
What the heck? You weren't 
serious about me at all!

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:22.290
Wow... I never knew rejections 
could be so smooth.

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:24.100
Hosokawa-san really is amazing.

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:26.850
Oh, but lately,

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:30.160
I think I might be able to become friends 
with someone who's a little different.

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:33.290
She's in my class, and her name is Miyamo-san.

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:34.660
She's the one with the glasses.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.620
We walk to school together 
every now and then.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:39.040
<i>Hosokawa-san is talking about me...</i>

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:39.050
She's really honest and cute.

00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:39.710
Oh, yeah?

00:13:42.660 --> 00:13:45.160
Hey! Why didn't I know about this?

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:47.340
You're friends with Hosokawa-san?!

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:49.170
Well, I, uh...

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:51.820
We just walk to school together sometimes...

00:13:51.820 --> 00:13:55.410
She mentioned that, 
but how did that even happen?

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:59.210
Um... I dove head-first into the 
garbage, and we became friends.

00:13:59.210 --> 00:14:00.330
Now I get it!

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:03.360
You want to abandon me and 
join their group, don't you?!

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.030
Fine, I see how it is!

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:05.030
That's not—

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:09.960
<i>Hosokawa-san was just... complimenting me...</i>

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.490
<i>This timing... sucks...</i>

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:19.920
Oh, my!

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:25.640
Shh!

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:32.740
That was close! 
They didn't see us, did they?!

00:14:32.740 --> 00:14:36.590
More importantly, how do people 
breathe when they're kissing?

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:39.260
Wait, did our lips actually touch? 
They didn't, right?

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:39.950
Right?

00:14:41.410 --> 00:14:43.440
I-I don't think they did...

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:48.490
Stop acting so meek!

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:50.600
What was that for? You dummy!

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:55.370
H-Hey, Chio-chan.

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:58.160
<b>Bump of Slave</b>

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:56.870
Good morning, Miyamo-san.

00:14:57.350 --> 00:14:59.540
What is this pairing? It's so fresh!

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:04.430
Why are you with Hosokawa-san, Manana?

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:05.500
Well, actually...

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:09.470
I was waiting for you when 
Hosokawa-san happened to pass by.

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:10.890
Hey, it's a celebrity.

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:13.630
Hey, you're Miyamo-san's friend, right?

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:14.880
Y-Yes...

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:16.640
Can I wait with you, too?

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:17.590
S-Sure!

00:15:17.590 --> 00:15:19.920
Yay! I'm Hosokawa.

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:21.650
Before I realized, we ended up 
walking to school together...

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:21.650
I'm Nonomura!

00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:25.230
<i>Hosokawa-san is amazing... She's so friendly.</i>

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:33.030
<i>Wow... The three of us are 
actually walking together.</i>

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:34.700
Oh, by the way...

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:37.950
There's something that I want 
to ask you, Hosokawa-san.

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:40.670
Sure. Ask me anything.

00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:42.710
Are you a virgin?

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:50.470
H-Hey! What the hell are you asking?!

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:52.430
Why would you ask such an 
awful question?! Right?!

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:57.970
I've... never gone out with anyone, so...

00:15:58.120 --> 00:16:00.950
What? But I heard that you're super popular.

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:03.890
They say Haruki-kun from the 
basketball team asked you out!

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:06.850
Wait, that's already spread so fast?

00:16:06.850 --> 00:16:09.150
<i>You're the one who spread that information!</i>

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:10.610
Ahem...

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:15.130
Then, um... Do you guys 
do that kind of stuff?

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:17.110
She definitely hasn't!

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:20.330
Really? Then have either of you kissed?

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:27.630
<i>W-We decided that our lips didn't 
actually touch that time...</i>

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:28.170
I have.

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:29.550
What?! Manana, that was—

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:32.090
I was in middle school, and the 
other person was in college...

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:34.550
In middle school? That's amazing!

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:36.930
Well, we met online...

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:38.100
<i>What?!</i>

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:40.000
How did you meet online?

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:42.350
<i>I-I had no idea she was hiding 
that this whole time...</i>

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:42.040
It's embarrassing, but we 
met in an online battle game

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:44.180
that I was into, and we 
somehow teamed up a lot.

00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:48.150
<i>Wait... What is this? Manana 
suddenly feels so far away...</i>

00:16:44.180 --> 00:16:46.590
Then we started messaging each other and...

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:51.690
You can basically have a 
society with three people.

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:59.200
Chi-oh

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:56.150
<i>I'm the central person in our three,</i>

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:59.200
<i>so I figured I would be the one 
who could choose in this society.</i>

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:02.080
Hey, what should we do today?

00:17:02.260 --> 00:17:04.410
It's time for your studies right now.

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:05.920
Aw, but I'm not interested.

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:08.760
They say that pursuits become habits.

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:09.880
Yeah, don't care.

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:11.130
"Heroides."

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:11.900
Huh?

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:13.720
Ovid.

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:15.180
Oho.

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:18.100
Are you well-versed in literature?

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:19.480
H-Hey, hello? Hey.

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:21.970
Before my fall, I had majored 
in Latin literature.

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:21.120
Hey, hey...

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:23.100
I see.

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:24.810
How about "Metamorphoses"?

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:27.150
I'm fond of the Icarus episode.

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:28.710
Narcissus...

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:31.060
No! This is too hard! No!

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:31.390
Changed literature.

00:17:31.060 --> 00:17:32.570
Ooh, yummy grapes.

00:17:31.390 --> 00:17:32.570
What about Shakespeare?

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:35.650
<i>Manana...</i>

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:39.200
So there seems to be a trick to it...

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:42.180
<i>That brat is trying to use 
me as a stepping stool</i>

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:43.910
<i>to get into Hosokawa-san's good graces!</i>

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:45.880
<i>There were signs, too.</i>

00:17:46.530 --> 00:17:48.290
<i>This is truly...</i>

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:50.590
<i>a betrayal!</i>

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:53.300
Curse you, you damn slave!

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:57.290
<i>Looks like you finally get it, Chio-chan.</i>

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:59.720
<i>You were pretty useful.</i>

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:03.100
<i>Now, I'm going to use my 
connection with Hosokawa-san</i>

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.390
<i>to join the elites at our school.</i>

00:18:06.260 --> 00:18:08.550
<i>I doubt we'll ever be 
speaking to each other again,</i>

00:18:08.550 --> 00:18:10.060
<i>but I did enjoy our time together.</i>

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:13.610
<i>Goodbye, Chio-chan.</i>

00:18:16.230 --> 00:18:19.360
Wow, Nonomura-san. You're so mature.

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:21.290
Well, I was pretty young.

00:18:21.290 --> 00:18:24.120
I went through some hardships, 
but I know how to pick my men now.

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:25.790
For example,

00:18:26.190 --> 00:18:30.680
that guy over there is going to end up 
a grunt at some company with no future.

00:18:30.680 --> 00:18:31.460
What?

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:36.310
Men who have no idea how society 
views them are so dumb...

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:36.310
Morning, Yuki-chan.

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:37.800
Good morning!

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:39.890
What?!

00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:42.720
Oh, sorry. Are you with a friend?

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:47.170
This is Ushida-san. He works 
at an office near our school.

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:50.350
Yuki-chan is my running coach.

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:52.270
<i>Her network is way too broad!</i>

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:55.820
She talked to me one night while I 
was on a night run to lose weight.

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:59.280
Um... The way you're running 
is really bad for your knees!

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:02.480
She teaches me things every 
time we bump into each other.

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:05.260
When you get actual running shoes, 
you can really tell the difference.

00:19:03.340 --> 00:19:07.040
<i>So he's dressed like that because 
Hosokawa-san recommended it...</i>

00:19:05.260 --> 00:19:07.490
Are you walking all the 
way to the office again?

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:08.360
<i>What's with her fashion—</i>

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:08.360
Yes.

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:11.400
A president can't set an example 
for his employees if he's fat, so...

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:10.300
<i>President?!</i>

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:14.380
Man, it's rough. Lately, I just wipe 
down with a wet towel and change,

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:17.630
but I'm thinking of adding 
shower rooms at the office.

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:27.070
Oh? Oh, what's this? What?

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:29.230
It's Nonomura-san from the normie group!

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:33.230
Oh, I'm sorry that someone like 
me suddenly talked to you.

00:19:34.890 --> 00:19:36.110
Huh? What?

00:19:37.850 --> 00:19:39.850
Oh, my gosh! Your face is so pretty!

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:42.360
I'm sorry, your beauty almost sucked me in!

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:46.180
Man, you elites sure are beautiful.

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:47.620
You must go to a lot of mixers.

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:48.650
That's so cool!

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:50.290
Oh, I was thinking, hup!

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:51.620
Nonomura-san, hup!

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:53.210
That story from your 
middle school days, hup!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:55.870
About how you kissed 
some college guy, hup, hup!

00:19:55.870 --> 00:19:58.040
Could you tell me about it, hup, 
so I can learn from it?

00:19:58.040 --> 00:19:59.430
It was a lie!

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:01.880
It was all a lie.

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:04.390
I've never kissed a guy.

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:07.350
I just ripped off something 
I read in a fashion magazine.

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:10.270
I see. Thank goodness.

00:20:10.530 --> 00:20:13.300
I'm glad some lolicon 
bastard that had the nerve

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:15.690
to seduce a middle-schooler 
wasn't your first kiss.

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:17.900
Chio-chan...

00:20:18.390 --> 00:20:19.320
Manana...

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:21.000
Welcome back.

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:29.160
So, apparently that old guy is 
a president of some company.

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:30.330
Yeah, I heard.

00:20:30.840 --> 00:20:32.520
He doesn't look so important.

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:33.540
I know, right?!

00:20:33.930 --> 00:20:37.920
If I were some old guy and 
Hosokawa-san suddenly talked to me,

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:39.760
I'd get so worked up and...

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:42.100
Huh? My job?!

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:45.430
I, um... I'm actually the 
president of a company.

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:46.640
Hey, I get it now.

00:20:47.670 --> 00:20:48.890
Pardon us!

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:50.980
We heard that you were some president!

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:55.160
Could we ask you what your job is like?

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:56.950
I'm so sorry, but she's 
enamored with economics.

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:57.420
Oh, do you have a business card?

00:20:57.420 --> 00:20:59.070
You're interested too, right, Hosokawa-san?

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:00.130
Hm?

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:03.990
I'm so sorry! I was lying about everything!

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:07.900
I'm just a grunt... I wanted to seem cool!

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:09.420
Yeah, yeah, we get it.

00:21:09.420 --> 00:21:13.110
There are women who dig up 
people's relationship histories.

00:21:13.110 --> 00:21:13.790
Gulp.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:16.810
Oh, that's okay! Sometimes, during meets,

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:19.210
I'll purposely act like I'm not feeling well.

00:21:19.620 --> 00:21:22.420
Ushida-san, there's only 
one important thing here.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:25.220
The distance you ran isn't a lie!

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:29.260
And so, whenever we're feeling 
down, let's all go for a run!

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:31.040
Huh? Hosokawa-san?

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:32.850
Why are we running?

00:21:33.290 --> 00:21:35.520
<i>Maybe Hosokawa-san just wants to run...</i>

00:21:36.420 --> 00:21:38.190
<i>That's what I thought at first,</i>

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:41.110
<i>but eventually, it actually 
ended up being fun.</i>

00:21:41.390 --> 00:21:46.490
<i>Maybe it doesn't really 
matter how others view you.</i>

00:21:52.390 --> 00:21:55.040
I want to tell them to stop running,

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:59.960
but look at their happy faces— 
Who the hell is that old guy?!

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:32.580
Next time on <i>Chio's School Road</i>,

00:23:32.580 --> 00:23:37.050
"Bloody Butterfly Effect 2" 
and "The Kabaddic Four."

00:23:37.050 --> 00:23:38.480
Look forward to it!

00:23:38.480 --> 00:23:39.980
This is awesome!
